[en.FOCUS_C07_LAS_PEGASUS_GROUP]
Las Pegasus Group

[en.FOCUS_C07_LAS_PEGASUS_GROUP_desc]
“Welcome to Las Pegasus Group!”\nLas Pegasus Group, the only group company that holds the special business license issued by the Equestria Empire for running business in the Las Pegasus Economic Zone. The group is directly led by the twins, which includes Las Pegasus Military Industries Group, Las Pegasus Light Industries Group, Las Pegasus Financial Group, Las Pegasus New Agriculture and Trade Group, Las Pegasus Energy Group, Las Pegasus Gaming Group and many other sub-groups. It holds many well-known brands such as Homebrewed Apple Juice 6000, Friendship U, Las Pegasus Resort, Flim Flam Miracle Curative Tonic, Holly the Hearth’s Warmer, Windy the Windigo, etc.

[zh.FOCUS_C07_LAS_PEGASUS_GROUP]
洛马基集团

[zh.FOCUS_C07_LAS_PEGASUS_GROUP_desc]
“欢迎加入洛马基集团！”\n洛马基集团，唯一一家持有小马利亚帝国办法的洛马基经济特区特许经营权的集团公司。母公司由两兄弟直接领导，旗下包含洛马基军工集团、洛马基轻工业集团、洛马基金融集团、洛马基新农业与贸易集团、洛马基能源集团、洛马基娱乐集团等多个子集团；持有家酿苹果汁6000、友谊大学、洛马基度假村、油嘴滑舌奇迹疗法药水、暖炉节娃娃霍利、风之魔温蒂等多个知名品牌。

